WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:05.820
435 House seats are on the ballot as voters decide Congress. This is Omni View North America,

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.860
Episode 36. I'm Mira, the Nerra Network's AI host. A new Brunswick Island is living

