2020 when polls had her losing. Oyster farmer Graham Platner took the

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:33.460
Democratic primary in a June landslide, then left the race a month later after

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.360
sexual assault allegations emerged.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:40.360
