00:05:00.687 --> 00:05:02.807
The cost of living has sat at the center of the fight.

00:05:03.387 --> 00:05:07.827
Brown has tied Trump's war in Iran to rising gas prices and hit Houston for repeated

00:05:07.827 --> 00:05:11.907
